#Fizzleworth-prep-sever.lic
#
# Prep for a spell-sever area (the Rift): every spell outside the 100s, 400s, 700s and 1700s is
# stripped there. This is just `;Fizzleworth-prep sever` -- the whole prep (rubs, Crooked
# Intent, the 1700s from scrolls, weapon, the per-hunt ultima resets, the demon follow order, the
# helper scripts) without the walk to Icemule's weapon shop. It used to be a stripped copy of
# prep from Oct 5 that missed everything added since (the ultima resets above all); one script
# keeps the two from drifting apart again. Put `script Fizzleworth-prep-sever` in the profile's
# hunting prep commands.

Script.run("Fizzleworth-prep", "sever")
